msgctxt "200"
msgid "(Hah... phew... What the hell? When did he get so agile?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "(Damn. Guess I should head back to the shop...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Oh... Did he get away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Okay. Well... if he comes back, I might have to ask you for help again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Urgh... hah... Are... are you...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Hey, it's me! You know, the old Kamurocho dine-and-dasher!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Wait, you're <Italic>that</Italic> dine-and-dasher? But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Oh, I tried, but I just couldn't give it up. I dashed my way across Japan, "
"and, well... Look how much weight I lost!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"I run a popular blog, too! Maybe you've heard of the \"Dine and Dash Diet\" "
"going around?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Never mind. Just come back to the shop with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Pork rib noodles, bitter melon stir-fry... It comes to 2,300 yen. If you "
"can't pay, you can wash dishes for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I'm so sorry. I just can't help myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"I'll let you go this time, but remember that dining and dashing is a crime. "
"Don't ever do this again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Thank you for bringing him to justice. I just don't know what kids these "
"days are thinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Gold Plate<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "I knew it'd be you! You're the only man who can catch me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Look, just give it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! My new diet made me famous, and I even got a girlfriend! That "
"manager from the gelato place, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"I've got a thing for strong women. I sorta fell for her when she was "
"scolding me, and now we're on a vacation together. Eheh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"So... what I'm trying to say is, I'm done for real. Today marks my final "
"dash. Cause no matter what thrills I get from it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "It can't compare to the special lady in my life!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "(I don't get it, but at least he's done.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Ho boy... Should have known he'd pull this stunt again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"That dine-and-dasher came back! He insisted he'd pay this time if we just "
"let him eat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "But then the bill comes, and out the door he goes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Oh... He's back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"I just want to know why he keeps doing this. I got the sense he's not "
"having money troubles or anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Could you catch the dine-and-dasher? If you help, I'll dig up some reward "
"for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "Sorry. Not much I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "All right... Sorry to have bothered you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "Oh, no... He got away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Fine. I just need to catch him, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Sorry to drag you into this. I'll make sure it's worth your time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "It's been years since our last dine and dash... How do I handle this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid "Wow, a dine-and-dasher... We haven't had one in almost twenty years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Hey! There he is! Over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "What do I do? I can't leave the shop, but I can't just let him go, either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"Could you catch the dine-and-dasher? I'm sure I can find something to pay "
"you with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "Sorry. Not much I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "All right... Sorry to have bothered you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Oh, no... He got away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "Fine. I just need to catch him, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Sorry to drag you into this. I'll make sure it's worth your time."
msgstr ""

